<br/>Design: 3

<br/>The typeface and treatment of the type hurts this image.</td>', 'Photograph: 7 

Design: 3

The typeface and treatment of the type hurts this image.', '2021-11-15 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706712, 1265740, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the creative design and composition. One of my pet peeves is when a font that is supposed to look handwritten has letters that look the exact same - so that''s a small personal thing but overall the image and type work well.</td>', 'I like the creative design and composition. One of my pet peeves is when a font that is supposed to look handwritten has letters that look the exact same - so that''s a small personal thing but overall the image and type work well.', '2021-11-15 09:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706713, 1265714, 38032, '<td valign="top">beautiful and engaging photo. As for the text, it''s taking away from the awesome image.</td>', 'beautiful and engaging photo. As for the text, it''s taking away from the awesome image.', '2021-11-15 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706714, 1265647, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The font and the image. I think it might have worked better with slightly different use of text, but still among the top 5 for me.</td>', 'I like this one. The font and the image. I think it might have worked better with slightly different use of text, but still among the top 5 for me.', '2021-11-15 09:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706715, 1265702, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice strong composition and design.</td>', 'Nice strong composition and design.', '2021-11-15 09:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706717, 1265649, 38032, '<td valign="top">My top choice in this challenge. So many good photos but others let the type get in the way. This one, well, you used two different serif fonts closely together which isn''t ideal - but the image is able to hold its own.</td>', 'My top choice in this challenge. So many good photos but others let the type get in the way. This one, well, you used two different serif fonts closely together which isn''t ideal - but the image is able to hold its own.', '2021-11-15 09:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706757, 1265751, 24454, '<td valign="top">Excellent photography for what would surely be an amazing coffee table book.</td>', 'Excellent photography for what would surely be an amazing coffee table book.', '2021-11-15 14:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706758, 1265327, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love it.  It has just the right moodiness and drama to make you want to buy this book to learn this genre of photography.</td>', 'I love it.  It has just the right moodiness and drama to make you want to buy this book to learn this genre of photography.', '2021-11-15 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706759, 1265666, 24454, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2021-11-15 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706760, 1265665, 24454, '<td valign="top">Good job.  This is a perfect cover for a novel about Covid!</td>', 'Good job.  This is a perfect cover for a novel about Covid!', '2021-11-15 14:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706761, 1265714, 24454, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite so far into the voting.  I''m biased with art like this.  It''s my favorite, so naturally, it enhances any book cover design immensely!  Good Luck!</td>', 'This one is my favorite so far into the voting.  I''m biased with art like this.  It''s my favorite, so naturally, it enhances any book cover design immensely!  Good Luck!', '2021-11-15 14:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706762, 1265702, 24454, '<td valign="top">The artistry of this cover is fabulous!</td>', 'The artistry of this cover is fabulous!', '2021-11-15 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706763, 1265740, 24454, '<td valign="top">The photography and font types for a book with this title are perfect.  There''s another one in this challenge with the same title with a completely different feel to it -- and both are excellent. There''s something about showing just half the girl that I think adds to the mood.  It really works for me.</td>', 'The photography and font types for a book with this title are perfect.  There''s another one in this challenge with the same title with a completely different feel to it -- and both are excellent. There''s something about showing just half the girl that I think adds to the mood.  It really works for me.', '2021-11-15 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706764, 1265649, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  The faded background.  The scale that the people on the bridge give this.  The sepia tones.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like this one.  The faded background.  The scale that the people on the bridge give this.  The sepia tones.  Good job.', '2021-11-15 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706765, 1265755, 24454, '<td valign="top">You can''t do a bad book cover with these amazing animals as your subject.  Their expressions... and they are so humanlike in their interactions with each other.  Grabs my heart.</td>', 'You can''t do a bad book cover with these amazing animals as your subject.  Their expressions... and they are so humanlike in their interactions with each other.  Grabs my heart.', '2021-11-15 15:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706766, 1265400, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so delightful and perfectly composed.  I''ve voted on 20 of 28 images, and this one is so far one of my top 2 picks. The photograph itself just feels joyful, which is what "the book" celebrates.  The dark colors with that pop of bright red and little splashes of pastels are so appealing. I also love how you have cropped the hat to make her face a nice close-up. I hope to see this one on the podium when it is all said and done.</td>', 'This is so delightful and perfectly composed.  I''ve voted on 20 of 28 images, and this one is so far one of my top 2 picks. The photograph itself just feels joyful, which is what "the book" celebrates.  The dark colors with that pop of bright red and little splashes of pastels are so appealing. I also love how you have cropped the hat to make her face a nice close-up. I hope to see this one on the podium when it is all said and done.', '2021-11-15 15:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706767, 1265756, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this artwork.  It looks like a coffee table book that would in fact make me pick it up and look thru it.</td>', 'I love this artwork.  It looks like a coffee table book that would in fact make me pick it up and look thru it.', '2021-11-15 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706768, 1265753, 24454, '<td valign="top">Such creative artwork.  I love how you did that butterfly.</td>', 'Such creative artwork.  I love how you did that butterfly.', '2021-11-15 15:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706769, 1265647, 24454, '<td valign="top">There''s our Toddy again... posing like a prince in his empire.  It couldn''t be better and would make an excellent book.  Hopefully, you will actually be writing this one  :)</td>', 'There''s our Toddy again... posing like a prince in his empire.  It couldn''t be better and would make an excellent book.  Hopefully, you will actually be writing this one  :)', '2021-11-15 15:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706770, 1265664, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is clearly one of the best in this challenge in my opinion.  The moody artwork and your composition are perfect for the title.  Also, for me, fog always ups my love of any photo :)</td>', 'This is clearly one of the best in this challenge in my opinion.  The moody artwork and your composition are perfect for the title.  Also, for me, fog always ups my love of any photo :)', '2021-11-15 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706771, 1265743, 24454, '<td valign="top">What can I say... this is beyond perfect in every way!  The artwork is gorgeous, and I love the silhouetted overlay of the man and his dog on the bench.  I''m sure this is just a matter of making the blue ribbon official because I don''t think any other image in this challenge comes close to what you''ve done here.  Congratulations in advance.  If I could give it a 12 vote, I would... but 10 will have to do :)</td>', 'What can I say... this is beyond perfect in every way!  The artwork is gorgeous, and I love the silhouetted overlay of the man and his dog on the bench.  I''m sure this is just a matter of making the blue ribbon official because I don''t think any other image in this challenge comes close to what you''ve done here.  Congratulations in advance.  If I could give it a 12 vote, I would... but 10 will have to do :)', '2021-11-15 15:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7706776, 1265582, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cover design, well done! 

